-- SI7-BLIZZ step 3: 29733 Lost in the Woods - the "4 ambushers dead" counter never reached Amber, so the scene only ended by the 60 s failsafe.
-- Root cause (core, dev worktree ~/work97int): SmartScript.cpp:1365-1368 `case SMART_ACTION_SET_COUNTER: StoreCounter(...)` stores the counter on the script that runs the action (the dying hozen itself) and ignores the target (target_type 19 / 55343 on 55344/55454 id 1 was never used). The ambusher death event itself DOES fire (SmartAI.cpp:658-662 JustDied -> SMART_EVENT_DEATH; proven on dev 4-11 11:11:58 with a temporary say, 3x). Fix in SQL only: the dying ambusher sends SET_DATA (action 45, field 1 value 1) to Amber (works across scripts, same as the existing Data 9 despawn); Amber counts them herself with a local SET_COUNTER (action 63) on DATA_SET (event 38), her existing id 1 (event 77 counter 1 = 4) then sends Data 4/1 to the Rell vehicle.
-- Source: own client test on dev 4-11-2026 (core read + live test); counter mechanism derived, not sniffed.
-- Rollback: UPDATE `smart_scripts` SET `action_type`=63,`action_param1`=1,`action_param2`=1,`action_param3`=0,`target_param1`=55343,`target_param2`=120,`comment`='Ambushing Hozen - On Death - Add 1 to counter 1 of the Rell vehicle' WHERE `source_type`=0 AND `entryorguid` IN (55344,55454) AND `id`=1; DELETE FROM `smart_scripts` WHERE `source_type`=0 AND `entryorguid`=55343 AND `id`=2; then .reload smart_scripts (only when no scene summons live). Pre-state dump: ~/backup/si7blizz_pre11_20261104.sql (dev).
